      "content": "ETH trading volume has overtaken BTC, BNB up 5.702% in a single day: altcoins have started the feast\n\nMidday quick report: BNB is up 5.702% on the day, ETH 2.19%, BTC? 0.402%. Bitcoin is at 79824 pretending to be asleep, while the altcoins have already started eating.\n\nToday’s most eye-catching number: ETH 24-hour trading volume is 4.1B USDT, while BTC is only 3.94B. The second-largest coin’s volume beating the first is something you don’t see every day. Money never waits for a signal; it votes directly.\n\nFunding rates are even more interesting: BTC is only 0.002817%, so low it’s basically nonexistent; ETH is 0.01%; XRP is outright -0.000748%, with shorts still paying to hold on while the price has risen 1.603%. What does this mean? This rally wasn’t built on leverage; it was driven by spot buying. A rise with low funding is a hundred times healthier than a violent squeeze.\n\nRetail traders are still asking in groups, “When will BTC break out?” The moment they ask that, ETH is already at 2503.03, having climbed above the daily sell point at 2499.94 — not only up, but also standing on top of resistance. If it pulls back to 2451.05 and doesn’t break, the pace is still in the bulls’ hands.\n\nBTC may be sluggish, but it doesn’t look bad on the books: 79824 is holding above the pivot at 79789.97, the intraday high is 80167, and the daily sell point at 80174.73 is right overhead. The key watch item this afternoon is simple: take 80174.73 on volume, and the altcoins keep flying; fail to take it, and a pullback to 79412.93 is the more attractive level to watch.\n\nBNB is today’s attention magnet: it ripped from the intraday low of 720.95 all the way to 781.44, and is now at 763.34. If you want to chase, look up first — the daily sell point at 792.35 is right above you. Do the math on the value yourself.\n\nBias: bullish. Volume is in ETH and BNB, funding isn’t overheated, and as long as BTC holds 79412.93 there’s no reason to flip bearish. Only after losing 79412.93 should we talk about risk; until then, don’t mistake “feels like it should fall” for a strategy.\n\nOne last line for those staring at Bitcoin and waiting for the starting gun: this round’s gunshot is over in altcoins — and you’re already half a day late.\n\n$BTC daily sell point: $80175 daily buy point: $79413\n$ETH daily sell point: $2499.94 daily buy point: $2451.05\n$BNB daily sell point: $792.35 daily buy point: $730.64\n$BTC #BTC $ETH #ETH",
